        "Elynas",
        "Mamere's father"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Mamere"
      ],
      "comment": "Mamere: Elynas",
      "content": "Elynas is the 'father' of the Melusines; Mamere is the only one who still hears him. Jakob tried to revive Elynas using blood, but the Traveler stopped his heart from restarting. Elynas thanked the Traveler and asked them to pass his blessing to Mamere, which they did.\n\nMamere sometimes painted with Elynas's blood; this was what Jakob wanted to obtain.",
