        "Seymour",
        "mechanical dog",
        "Recon Log Mek",
        "Prototype 4ACV07"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mamere: Seymour",
      "content": "Seymour, officially Prototype 4ACV07, is a Recon Log Mek made by Alain Guillotin to help Mary-Ann in the Marechaussee Phantom. He was badly damaged and dormant for roughly 493 years until Mamere found him. Her token, his relay module, restarted him. He wants to find his master and travels with Mamere.\n\nHe speaks formally and cautiously, warns people when they break Fontaine's rules, and he regards Mamere as someone to protect.",
